# Build context hygiene for repo-root-context image builds
# (deploy/compose/docker/*.Dockerfile).
#
# The host image copies platform/; the worker image also copies agents/
# (agent SDK workspace); the dashboard image copies dashboard/. Those
# trees stay IN the context — only their junk is excluded.
.git
.agents
.claude
.opencode
audit-data
control-plane
tests
openspec
**/bin
**/obj
**/*.user
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
dashboard/storybook-static
artifacts
